// Windows resource script: embeds the app icon (id 1) so Explorer shows it on
// the .exe and the tray/Settings windows can LoadIcon it. Compiled by llvm-rc
// in CI and linked into ReLayoutWin via -Xlinker. Icon id 1 is also the lowest,
// so Explorer/Alt-Tab pick it as the application icon automatically.
1 ICON "relayout.ico"
// "rL" glyphs that follow the theme, like the macOS menu-bar icon: dark letters on
// light (2), white on dark (3). The tray picks by the taskbar, Settings' logo by the
// app mode. Made from Resources/for-{light,dark}-text-1024.png, 16-256 px.
2 ICON "tray-on-light.ico"
3 ICON "tray-on-dark.ico"
// App manifest (RT_MANIFEST = 24): pulls in ComCtl32 v6 for themed controls +
// the SysLink class, and declares per-monitor-v2 DPI awareness.
1 24 "app.manifest"
